                  "text": "30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ga agata yi be, ma tri yi, ma co yi ma azi ’diyi, ma si yi ma dri’bi; ma omi yi oyo sozu Mungu rusi kini, Emi ma fe ezoanzi emini agianzi yini dri okuru ku, emi ma je vini ezoanzi yini agianzi emini dri okuru ku, emi i ngulupi dri ku indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
